# YAML Schema Definitions Directory
#
# Contains JSON Schema (Draft 7) definitions for PTF data structures:
# - task.schema.yaml       - Atomic unit of work
# - artifact.schema.yaml   - File produced/consumed by tasks
# - dependency.schema.yaml - Relationship between tasks
# - wave.schema.yaml       - Set of parallel tasks
# - plan.schema.yaml       - Complete execution blueprint
#
# Schemas enable IDE validation and documentation generation.
